---A conversion event in a Google Analytics property.
---@class gcp.analyticsadmin_v1beta.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1betaConversionEvent
---@field deletable? boolean Output only. If set, this event can currently be deleted with DeleteConversionEvent.
---@field eventName? string Immutable. The event name for this conversion event. Examples: 'click', 'purchase'
---@field custom? boolean Output only. If set to true, this conversion event refers to a custom event. If set to false, this conversion event refers to a default event in GA. Default events typically have special meaning in GA. Default events are usually created for you by the GA system, but in some cases can be created by property admins. Custom events count towards the maximum number of custom conversion events that may be created per property.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Time when this conversion event was created in the property.
---@field countingMethod? gcp.analyticsadmin_v1beta.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1betaConversionEventCountingMethodEnum Optional. The method by which conversions will be counted across multiple events within a session. If this value is not provided, it will be set to `ONCE_PER_EVENT`.
---@field defaultConversionValue? gcp.analyticsadmin_v1beta.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1betaConversionEventDefaultConversionValue Optional. Defines a default value/currency for a conversion event.
---@field name? string Identifier. Resource name of this conversion event. Format: properties/{property}/conversionEvents/{conversion_event}

---@alias gcp.analyticsadmin_v1beta.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1betaConversionEventCountingMethodEnum "CONVERSION_COUNTING_METHOD_UNSPECIFIED"|"ONCE_PER_EVENT"|"ONCE_PER_SESSION"

---Defines a default value/currency for a conversion event. Both value and currency must be provided.
---@class gcp.analyticsadmin_v1beta.GoogleAnalyticsAdminV1betaConversionEventDefaultConversionValue
